{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_8_level_st_08-05",
  "groupId": "main_8",
  "stageId": "st_08-05",
  "title": "厄运，等候已久",
  "storyCode": "M8-5",
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_08-05.txt",
  "sourceHash": "7969d0ef7ad28b2556feeb2ea775bacd84e88c3b86951c90561d1e89ef73b8a9",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "现在线5"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "通讯接通了！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是队长吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "是我，是我！你们现在怎么样了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们其他人还好，虽然现在被困在地下这个建筑里了，但我们找到了通道用门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "过段时间我们找到其他出口就来和你们汇合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们已经切断了重启功能。你们要过来也可以放心，整片区域都能用来防守了，可以不用担心会被人打个措手不及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "碧银姐，碧银姐她......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......不，不，迷迭香！等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "继续任务......不准来找我们！我们出来之前，你签过保证书的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "可是......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "既然答应了，就不能反悔！否则我们是不会支持你，也不会跟着你来到切城的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "还记得我们加入你小队的时候，我们商量了什么吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听着，队长，听我说......我们说过，每个精英干员和他们的小队都不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你能做的事情很多，你的法术很强，我们实际上支援不了你什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但是，你没法忍受的那些东西，我们是会和你共同承担的，和阿米娅一样，和其他精英干员一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "但你们都是我的队员！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别急！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "碧银姐她最后说了，我们答应过你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "要让你成长成一个战士，不是士兵，也不是武器。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "队长，做你该做的。我们会安全出来的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "听好，队长，这可能很难。但碧银姐就是这么说了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "“你不只是精英干员，你是迷迭香。不光队员们，罗德岛以及感染者，这里讨厌失去和破坏的人......都会爱你。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "所以，队长，“想想看，‘迷迭香’会做什么”。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "我们挂断了。替我们向阿米娅问好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "别离开我。要记得回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香小队成员",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "一定记得。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......通讯结束。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "状况怎么样？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊，阿米娅。工程小组一人牺牲，其他人暂且还安全。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "迷迭香......我们的正面火力有点不足。游击队的迫击炮小队需要补给。我们要打个时间差。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......你还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......阿米娅，Ace死了以后，你在想什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "啊......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "不想回答也行。我只是很想知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "抱歉，我不想想起太多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "阿米娅也会想要逃避吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不是，只是还没到重新面对的时候。眼泪要留到一切都结束之后。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我只记得最后，我觉得......我想起来——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不能让他和罗德岛的干员们白白死去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "侦查干员，告诉我方位，我去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "整合运动已经陷入了一片混乱，要小心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "迷迭香",
      "speakerToken": "avg_npc_042",
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "因为我们是他们的敌人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "因为什么都是他们的敌人。有的人在缺少敌人的时候，就会为自己创造敌人......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
      "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
      "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "担心什么？先锋小组，突击！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "狙击小组，后撤！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "狙击干员",
              "speakerToken": null,
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "明白！重整队形，补充弹药！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "重装干员们，为他们提供掩护！",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "重装干员",
              "speakerToken": null,
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "是！顶住！不要让通道被截断！"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "术师，停火！",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "术师干员",
              "speakerToken": null,
              "operatorId": null,
              "portraitKey": null,
              "text": "施术停止！小心，别波及友军！"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "牧群化萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_091",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不要再向前走！令人恐慌。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "牧群化萨卡兹战士",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_091",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "不要打人，痛苦！到处是痛苦。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "真是令人不快的感染倾向。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "他们已经不是人了。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "比起龙门的变异感染者更令人不安。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "你如果问我担心不担心迷迭香，阿米娅，以及他们带领的小队......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我只能坦白，担心是没用的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "计划已经制定好了，一切都在被设计好的轨道上运行，这时你挤在别人的轨道上，只会让两辆电车一起脱轨。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "牧群的战士没有前进的趋势......！"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "不要大意！我们的目标是通过，不是歼灭！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "分批次解决。我们没有完全处理整片战场的能力。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "阿米娅让人担心。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凯尔希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "阿米娅是成熟的领导者和优秀的战士。她熟悉小队的运作模式以及我们的作战目的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "迷迭香让人担心。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凯尔希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "迷迭香是强大的攻坚干员和最受小队支持的精英干员。她能够完整且合理地完成每一项任务，只要这个任务的运作模式是为她量身制订的。"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "label": "战况让人担心。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": [
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凯尔希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "切尔诺伯格已经身处风暴的中心，在这种情况下，我们微不足道的关心并不能改变战局的任何一个部分。"
            },
            {
              "type": "dialogue",
              "speakerName": "凯尔希",
              "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
              "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
              "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
              "text": "我们对他们最大的支援，就是成功达成我们小队的战略目标。"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": []
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "这样就够了？！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "是不是太没人情味了？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pith",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_095",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我不同意。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "她撑过了全部七项训练流程，在各个测试中取得的成绩都在合格以上。有三门是特别优秀。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pith",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_095",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我不相信这样的施术者。凯尔希，作为术师，我以源石技艺为豪，以让源石技艺福泽他人为业。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pith",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_095",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Rosmontis绝非这样的术师。她源石技艺的本质绝非服务人类的那类。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我希望她参与战斗，只出于一个考量。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "如果Rosmontis一直身在温室之中，一旦这个美好的环境破裂，她就会立刻成为一场灾难。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pith",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_095",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你下不了手的话我来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "Pith！"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pith",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_095",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你和阿米娅太相信他们的未来了。我们一步踏错，只会让别的人永远失去未来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "决断之前，至少先有所作为。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pith",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_095",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我畏惧那个没能决断的未来。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "现在。让她成为精英干员。不是未来，是现在。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我们现在教导她，打磨她，把她的力量铸造成型，以最高的标准去要求她，让她即使被天灾袭击也绝不动摇。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "直到大地上的一切都不能左右她。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "到那时候她才有可能真正摆脱哥伦比亚人丢给她的可怕命运，自己决定自己的人生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "这就是我的目的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pith",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_095",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "我知道你会这么说，凯尔希。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Pith",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_095",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "谁来保证？谁来做？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我需要你和我一起，需要精英干员们和我一起去做这件事。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "以及，我可以向你保证，只要我还活着，我们就一定能做到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "如果用温情和善良去渲染战争，那么战争只会变得更加危险。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "我不想这样去渲染一件既可怖又残酷的事情，即使我知道这件事从来不该发生。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "阿米娅与迷迭香，她们的监护人是整个罗德岛，以及罗德岛所有负有责任心的干员。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "在此之上，她们又是小队战术的核心，Dr.{@nickname}。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "凯尔希",
          "speakerToken": "char_003_kalts_1",
          "operatorId": "char_003_kalts",
          "portraitKey": "char_003_kalts",
          "text": "对她们有信心，就是对自己有信心。"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "喂，霍克，你看到了吗？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "怎么会没看到。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "你别说话，会暴露的。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（那你问我干什么？你可还在大声喧哗。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "（嘘，嘘，再这样说，你可要被队长骂了。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（她又说不了话，我怎么知道是她要骂我，还是假借她名义骂我。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "（我不会的。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（我知道。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "（......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "（我说......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（不说了，你是想问这摊东西。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "（这一箱箱的武器和护甲。还有这些摆得整整齐齐的机械。如果这是随手摆在这里的，那我一定也能随手捡到几百万维多利亚铸币。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（那些军备，我打赌两百块，就是乌萨斯的。我还在拉瓦勒搞走私的时候见过，这全都是新款的。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（除了中央军团，其他部队装备这些武器的时间......我猜，打底不超过五年。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "（你觉得，这些武器铠甲什么的，有多大概率只是整合运动抢来的？）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（整合运动那帮拿水管的，我看连怎么给这些东西上油都不会。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "（游击队呢？游击队可是乌萨斯军出身的。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（游击队，游击队离开所属集团军多少年了？那些又大又沉的铁家伙，只是被推进湖里就全都会淹死。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（就算当年他们有带勤务队出来，那勤务队可能也已经死光了。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（你想想，看他们现在的装备状况，他们能把自己那身铠甲擦擦干净就已经是谢天谢地。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（让他们来整理这些武器？他们可能连哪头是用来朝着敌人的都弄不清楚。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "（你这么一说，我感觉他们有点傻。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（傻和不懂是两回事。干后勤不仅要本事，还要知识。游击队也不蠢，只不过要正好碰到几个感染了逃出来的勤务官，这事儿想碰上都难。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（想赶在乌萨斯处决他们之前救下几个刚刚被感染的勤务官......难上加难。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（喏......装备编码被刮掉了。你可以说逃兵都喜欢这么干，但也可以说......）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "（要掩人耳目也会这么干。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "（手法也太外行了，这刮痕，我连锉铸码的锉刀是什么型号哪家厂子的都看得出。有些人，哈，只能说是被逼急了。）"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "可现在，最重要的是......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "......通知他们。现在通知他们，不管有没有用。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "希望还来得及。队长，是让Raidian把信息转给阿米娅她们，还是我们直接去和他们说？"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "我们要从后方牵制住整合运动和这些奇模怪样的家伙？知道了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "等等。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "有不明单位在靠近我们的位置。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "Mantra，你去吗？让他们忘记自己在做什么就行，先别给他们伪造命令啊把他们变成白痴啊什么的......"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "你的体力还很宝贵，要是我们真的和整合运动正面冲突了，要靠你化解风险。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "唔？嗯。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "“好。你们也小心。”"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "霍克",
          "speakerToken": "avg_npc_012",
          "operatorId": null,
          "portraitKey": null,
          "text": "知道了。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "那就......我就发信了，队长。就这个。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "极境",
          "speakerToken": "char_401_elysm",
          "operatorId": "char_401_elysm",
          "portraitKey": "char_401_elysm",
          "text": "“乌萨斯军在核心城。”"
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
